{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small venue, attract players to your football facility, expand your business and fill your arcade with fun machines and activities.<br>From managing football bookings to handling tokens and profits from arcade machines, it's your job to grow your entertainment empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a fully functional 5-a-side football pitch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and unlock a variety of arcade machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your entertainment area and football facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle tokens and profits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract different types of NPCs with unique needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your venue layout</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you build the ultimate sports and entertainment complex? The success of your business depends on your management skills!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3074280?t=1771863045","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3074280?t=1771863045","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074280/26399d0e3616b76178348d2891af1cebebadb5d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771863045","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074280/26399d0e3616b76178348d2891af1cebebadb5d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771863045","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small venue, at